description:
"LAY ALL YOUR LOVE ON ME" is a Warrior Cats MAP (multi animator project) focused on the complicated and dramatic relationship between Tigerheart and Dovewing, taking lots of inspiration from theatre! 

This MAP is finally here and I couldn't be more proud! Each animator worked SO HARD on their parts, and it truly shows! It was a long wait, but it was certainly worth it. Every part really is gorgeous and I could not be more thankful to everyone who helped bring my idea to life.

