This was a fun 'character' experiment we conducted with a lot of our voice actors to be more in tune with who we play as in the series! We hope you enjoy our version of absolute chaos in Among Us. BIG THANKS TO ALL OUR VA'S FOR PARTICIPATING! WE LOVED DOING THIS. 

Be sure to check out our audio book! We produce chapters for the Warriors Series that are FULLY voice acted!

For updates on new episodes and artwork, follow our twitter and join our discord! You can also talk to us there too! 
